text (Yes, this particular classroom...)
label 6
text I peek inside through the glass panel on the door.
text @[Tomoya]
text (There she is...)
text Unsurprisingly, a girl is sitting inside working diligently on her carving.
text She seems to be a lot more attentive to her work than the first time I saw her.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I guess she won't get hurt now that she's used to it... probably...)
choice Leave|I'll watch her just a bit more
setvar intF[1089] = selected
sound 02.aac
setvar intF[1089] - 1
if intF[1089] == 0
	goto s6
fi
goto 7
