text Ah, did she just...
text She starts looking around restlessly.
text And somehow, through the glass panel, she detects my watching eyes.
sound 26U.aac
text @[Female Student]
text ...!
text Before her usual "Wah..." even reaches my ear, she's already jumped up and run away.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Idiot, rushing like that only makes your wound worse.)
text I quickly enter the classroom.
